      "title": "Scaling Agentic AI Factories Through Extreme Co-Design with NVIDIA BlueField",
      "summary": "NVIDIA technical blog detailing how BlueField-4 DPUs offload, accelerate, and isolate networking, storage, security, and telemetry services inline from host CPUs, including KV-cache management via DOCA Memos for agentic AI factory data paths.",
