        "original_url": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/scaling-agentic-ai-factories-through-extreme-co-design-with-nvidia-bluefield/",
        "published_at": "2026-07-16"
      },
      "direction_id": "inline_datapath"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "9777fd307bcc43a78d89685f",
      "title": "Oasis: Hiding the Cost of Querying Parquet Files in the Datapath",
      "summary": "Oasis 是一种数据处理 SmartNIC，将 Parquet 解码作为定制硬件加速器卸载到网络数据路径，与 DuckDB 端到端集成；解码与查询执行重叠，在最佳情况下使 DuckDB 查询吞吐量接近翻倍。",
