      "candidate_id": "a23a796c3161fd1fadbaf610",
      "title": "TurboRetry: Mitigating Large-Scale QUIC Handshake Floods with Off-the-Shelf DPU Offloading",
      "summary": "TurboRetry 将 QUIC Retry 机制拆分并卸载到 DPU，同时在 on-path DPA 上执行连接授权；扩展 Retry token 维持协议语义并减少主机协同开销，吞吐比主机实现提高 10–20 倍。",
